://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/560a4223a3c2a4c6d0deae39aaa600b2.poster.avif?t=1775606410\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/560a4223a3c2a4c6d0deae39aaa600b2.webm?t=1775606410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><u> </u><br><br>  <br>■ <strong>Multi-Leveled Puzzles and Challenges</strong>: Engaging gameplay loops that include cooking simulations, tower defense strategies, competitive multiplayer modes, and team-based challenges. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/3cf567cbee3b9c9cca55d925d7da7744.poster.avif?t=1775606410\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/3cf567cbee3b9c9cca55d925d7da7744.webm?t=1775606410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>■ <strong>Multiplayer Co-op</strong>: Challenge your friendships by playing against them or play on the same side and upgrade your shop to the best of your crews abilities (Up to 8 players)<br> <br>  <br>■ <strong>OST</strong>: Original Soundtrack and sound effects crafted by Brightside Movement, enhancing the culinary adventure.  <br>■ <strong>Immersive Graphics</strong>: A unique stylized environment that helps create a vibrant and delicious world where players can truly experience the art of pizza making and tomatoe sauce spilling <br><br><u>Lore:</u><br>■ Mario Meatballs has always yearned to create the ultimate pizzeria, and now that he's found a spot within his budget, his dream has become a reality. But he will soon find out that there's a reason why the real estate was such a steal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this thrilling pizza-making simulation with a dash of tower defense, you'll step into Mario's shoes and manage every aspect of running a brick-and-mortar shop by day then at night fend off hordes of crazed lunatics and other totally normal things for a small business owner.  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                        <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/2d101f53339040f1b807a3deaed3b05d.poster.avif?t=1775606410\" width=533 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/2d101f53339040f1b807a3deaed3b05d.webm?t=1775606410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/85205d6ad7625006064ac7bdf72a5f91.poster.avif?t=1775606410\" width=800 height=535 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3398560/extras/85205d6ad7625006064ac7bdf72a5f91.webm?t=1775606410\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Congratulations on buying your very first store! However, prepare to quickly learn that this is not your average pizza franchise!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You run a pizza shop by day, doing the typical job simulator activities and then as night falls you experience the tower defense aspect of Slice &amp; Dice, fighting off hordes of angry customers, bosses &amp; disgruntled members of a rival pizza shops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying to keep your business afloat is the least of your problems when enemies grow in numbers each night and are trying to destroy your beloved Pizzeria. <br> <br> <br><u>Key Features </u><br><br><u> </u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.a